    "QuotaMew does not store this activity history on disk and does not read prompts, threads, source code, or credentials for this feature." : {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QuotaMew does not store this activity history on disk and does not read prompts, threads, source code, or credentials for this feature."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QuotaMew 不會將此活動紀錄儲存到磁碟，也不會為此功能讀取提示詞、對話串、原始碼或憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity values are reported by Codex and may not represent exact billing or subscription quota usage. Dates use the source-provided calendar buckets; the latest date is not necessarily your local today. History may be incomplete." : {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activity values are reported by Codex and may not represent exact billing or subscription quota usage. Dates use the source-provided calendar buckets; the latest date is not necessarily your local today. History may be incomplete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "活動數值由 Codex 回報，不一定代表精確的計費或訂閱額度用量。日期依來源提供的每日資料分組，最新日期不一定是你所在地的今天。活動紀錄可能不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
